<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Key Takeaways</strong></p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>Quick answer:</strong> For spice cabinet organization, store spices in a cool, dark cabinet near your prep space, not above the stove, toss any that have lost their smell, and use a tiered riser on standard shelves or a lazy susan in corners.</li>


<li>Store spices in a cool, dark cabinet near your prep space, not above the stove.</li>



<li>Use a tiered riser for standard shelves and a lazy susan for corners, so every label is visible.</li>



<li>Toss spices that have lost their smell, and write the open date on every new lid.</li>
