<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Where to Keep Spices (and How Long They Last)</h2>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Before you buy a single organizer, pick the right cabinet. Spices lose flavor faster with heat, light and moisture, so the cabinet right above the stove is usually the worst choice, even though it feels convenient.</p>



